  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.02 “Acid rain emissions limitation” means “Acid rain emissions limitation” as defined in 40 CFR 72.2. The term establishes a limitation on emissions of sulfur dioxide or nitrogen oxides under the Acid Rain Program under title IV of the Clean Air Act.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.03); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20",
